  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "普通用户也会遇到同样的手法。",
   "spoken": "普通用户也会遇到同样的手法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
