   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "招聘者让你下载项目、运行脚本、安装会议软件，先停下来。",
   "spoken": "招聘者让你下载项目、运行脚本、安装会议软件，先停下来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.7,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 4.7,
   "speechEnd": 9.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "不在存放钱包的电脑上，运行陌生项目，打开陌生文件。",
   "spoken": "不在存放钱包的电脑上，运行陌生项目，打开陌生文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 9.96,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 9.96,
   "speechEnd": 14.114
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "会议里，拒绝任何远程控制请求。",
   "spoken": "会议里，拒绝任何远程控制请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 14.58,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 14.58,
   "speechEnd": 17.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "客服主动联系你，说账户有风险，要你转移资产，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "spoken": "客服主动联系你，说账户有风险，要你转移资产，一律挂断，再从官方 App 里联系客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 17.68,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 17.68,
   "speechEnd": 25.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "如果你是签名人，今天就把聊天软件，从签名设备上删掉。",
   "spoken": "如果你是签名人，今天就把聊天软件，从签名设备上删掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 25.9,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 25.995,
   "speechEnd": 30.322
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "如果你是开发者，陌生项目一律先在隔离环境里打开。",
   "spoken": "如果你是开发者，陌生项目一律先在隔离环境里打开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 30.76,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 30.855,
   "speechEnd": 35.047
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你负责团队，查一遍离职清单，看它有没有覆盖边缘权限。",
   "spoken": "如果你负责团队，查一遍离职清单，看它有没有覆盖边缘权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 35.46,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 35.557,
   "speechEnd": 40.646
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
